<article class="node gutenberg-page gutenberg-page--full">
  
  

      
    
    <div class="node__content">
      
            <div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item">
<div class="wp-block-group bg-white is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-group container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-group lead is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<h1 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>CEU Nádor Event Center</strong>&nbsp;</h1>



<p class="has-text-align-center">We Create <strong>Space</strong> for Memorable Moments</p>



<p class="has-text-align-center h3"><strong>A Unique Event Venue<br>in the Heart of Budapest&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>



<p class="has-text-align-center px-5">Just a few steps from St. Stephen’s Basilica and the Danube River, we welcome our partners and clients in a stunning location. Opened in 2016, CEU Nádor Street site features modern and eco-friendly buildings, making it an ideal venue for events and conferences. The award-winning facilities include a 400-seat auditorium, session-/breakout rooms accommodating 16 to 75 guests, a rooftop garden, and catering services—all to ensure that your event is of the highest standard and delivers a truly unique experience.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-wide is-style-default"><img src="/sites/default/files/styles/wide/public/media_images/vegeldaniel.com-310687_1.jpg?itok=MJDKKS4k" alt="" class="wp-image-88" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="1a51ee55-0c1b-46d2-91f2-7d268a0f3152" data-image-style="original"/></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-wide"><img src="/sites/default/files/styles/wide/public/media_images/vegeldaniel.com-313210_0.jpg?itok=QiwQrGIZ" alt="" class="wp-image-89" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="a38862cd-7f46-4501-a151-518e0ae7c180" data-image-style="original"/></figure>
</figure>



<div class="ratio ratio-16x9"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Q24QivHiIds?si=5hPd5bZXtCyj0944&amp;controls=0" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>
</div></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Why Choose Us?&nbsp;</h3>



<p class="has-text-align-center">The CEU Nádor Event Center is more than just a traditional event venue—it’s a vibrant community space that adds unique value to every event. Our core values include quality, international engagement, openness, knowledge, and inclusivity, which create an inspiring environment for all our clients.</p>
</div></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">What We Offer</h3>



<div class="wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile is-image-fill"><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<ul>
<li>Our <strong>modern architectural solutions</strong> create a striking visual experience that leaves a lasting impression on visitors.&nbsp;</li>



<li>We’ve designed our services to make event planning and execution seamless and stress-free. While <strong>we provide all essential services</strong>, we also offer the flexibility to work with your own trusted partners.&nbsp;</li>



<li>Our high-quality facilities, supported by <strong>an experienced team</strong>, help transform good events into extraordinary ones.&nbsp;</li>



<li>Located at Nádor Street 13 and 15, our award-winning buildings achieve <strong>the highest standards</strong> in both design and environmental sustainability.&nbsp;</li>



<li><strong>Sustainability</strong> was a key focus in our planning and construction. We believe that an event venue reflects an organization’s values and vision. If you’re a leader who prioritizes sustainability, showcase your commitment by choosing a venue that aligns with your principles—one that your partners and colleagues will appreciate.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media" style="background-image:url(/sites/default/files/styles/wide/public/media_images/vegeldaniel.com-312758_1.jpg?itok=sYkKXUWI);background-position:88% 48%" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="2b69e60e-db0e-4f8b-a207-cf46961baf6d" data-image-style="original"><img src="/sites/default/files/styles/wide/public/media_images/vegeldaniel.com-312758_1.jpg?itok=sYkKXUWI" alt="" class="wp-image-205 size-wide" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="2b69e60e-db0e-4f8b-a207-cf46961baf6d" data-image-style="original"/></figure></div>
</div></div>



<div id="quote" class="wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-group container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Request a Personalized Quote Today!</h3>



<p class="has-text-align-center">Every event is unique and deserves special attention. We tailor our offer to match your specific needs—reach out to us with confidence!</p>



<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-layout-1 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://forms.office.com/e/7ftreDMdV1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Request a Quote</a></div>



<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/sites/default/files/2025-10/ceu_webmagazin_eng_v2_20251012_compressed.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Download Our Brochure</a></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</div></div>



<div id="about-us" class="wp-block-group bg-white is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-group container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">About Us</h2>



<div class="wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top" style="grid-template-columns:40% auto"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="/sites/default/files/styles/wide/public/media_images/vegeldaniel.com-312509_1.jpg?itok=mTHMAhmF" alt="" class="wp-image-206 size-wide" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="d7e1b446-aa6d-4a46-8f4a-0fe3a25e6104" data-image-style="original"/></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<p>Our dedicated team, with decades of extensive experience in event planning, provides all the support you need to ensure your event runs smoothly and aligns perfectly with your vision.&nbsp;</p>



<p>We bring passion and attention to detail to every event to ensure its success.&nbsp;</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left">What to Expect When You Host Your Event with Us?</h3>



<p class="has-text-align-left">After filling out the form, our colleagues will contact you to discuss all the details and tailor the event to your needs.</p>
</div></div>
</div></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
