<p class="has-text-align-center"><strong>Géza Batyik</strong><br>Security Manager</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<p class="has-text-align-center">Whether you’re planning your very first event or you’re a seasoned professional, we will guide you through each step of the venue coordination process, from the initial request and preparations to the day of the event and closing.</p>
</div></div>



<div id="our-services" class="wp-block-group bg-white is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<div class="wp-block-group container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Our Services</h2>



<p class="has-text-align-center">Corporate Events | Professional and Scientific Conference | Training  Sessions and Workshops | Presentations | Exhibitions | Artistic and Cultural Performances | Banquets | Receptions | Film Shoot Locations</p>



<figure class="wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-wide"><img src="/sites/default/files/styles/wide/public/media_images/vegeldaniel.com-311579_1.jpg?itok=Rg1mTVo8" alt="" class="wp-image-207" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="3ac5a48a-6e68-4ef2-b714-dc13b4cf271c" data-image-style="original"/></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-wide"><img src="/sites/default/files/styles/wide/public/media_images/vegeldaniel.com-312330_2.jpg?itok=CkbK0_9M" alt="" class="wp-image-208" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="744b2c95-ea33-44fe-8cc4-2f1be94a3bed" data-image-style="original"/></figure>
</figure>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Venue Rental</h3>



<p>Located in the heart of Budapest, the <em>CEU Nádor Event Center</em> is an easily accessible venue, situated near the UNESCO World Heritage area. Combining unique architectural solutions with modern technology, our spacious areas provide a truly memorable experience for all visitors.</p>



<p>Our<strong> auditorium</strong> is modern and elegant, with natural wood flooring and acoustic wall paneling. Depending on the type and size of the event, it is versatile and can be arranged with a stage and technical equipment, making it an ideal location for <strong>presentations, conferences</strong>, and <strong>cultural events</strong> for up to <strong>400 people</strong>.</p>



<p>Our <strong>conference rooms</strong> are equipped with 3 built-in PCs and smartboards and can accommodate <strong>34-75 people</strong>. Our IT services include video conferencing, broadcasting, and recording.</p>



<p>Our <strong>session-/breakout</strong> <strong>rooms</strong> and <strong>meeting rooms</strong> can accommodate <strong>16-55 people</strong> and are equipped with 2 built-in PCs and smartboards, with some featuring a projector. Video conferencing is also available in these rooms.</p>



<p>Explore our most popular spaces and rooms and find all the essential information you need by downloading our catalog.</p>



<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-layout-2 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/sites/default/files/2025-10/ceu_webmagazin_eng_v2_20251012_compressed.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Download Our Brochure</a></div>
</div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container">
<p>Would you like to invite your guests for a champagne toast with a 360-degree panoramic view of the city, where they can admire sights such as Buda Castle, Gellért Hill, the Parliament, and St. Stephen's Basilica?</p>



<p>We have the perfect solution! On our <strong>600 m2 rooftop terrace</strong> on the 7th floor, you and your guests can enjoy delicious food and drinks while soaking in the breathtaking view of the sun setting behind the Buda Hills.</p>



<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-layout-3 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
