</div>



<div class="wp-block-file"><a id="wp-block-file--media-4fb2f2e5-bda2-41c4-84d3-27f61e000464" href="/sites/default/files/2026-03/house_rules_and_regulations-budapest_site_web_external2026.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">You can read our house rules here</a></div>



