<h3 class="wp-block-heading">What’s Relevant Now?</h3>



<p>CEU Budapest invites mission-driven organizations to become part of its vibrant Nádor Street campus. This open call offers a unique opportunity to join an international academic and civic community committed to social impact, collaboration, and innovation in the heart of Budapest.</p>



