<div class="card mb-3 box">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-3 align-self-center">
        
<img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/media_images/image6.jpeg" width="283" height="283" alt="TASZ logo" class="img-fluid">


    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-9">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title fw-bold mb-3">TASZ</h3>
        <p>TASZ organizes several events each year, with one of our most important requirements being that the venue is accessible, which unfortunately is not always easy to find in Budapest. CEU can provide this for us, along with a simple and transparent room rental process. The venue is easily accessible and fully meets our expectations.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</div></span></div>
              </div>
                      </div>
        </div>
                                      <div  class="carousel-item">
          <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-sm-12 position-relative">
                  <div class="views-field views-field-nothing"><span class="field-content"><div class="caption-wrapper">
<div class="carousel-caption">
<div class="card mb-3 box">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-3 align-self-center">
        
<img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/media_images/konnekt_2.png" width="540" height="155" alt="Konnekt" class="img-fluid">


    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-9">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title fw-bold mb-3">Konnekt Association</h3>
        <p>The CEU Nádor Event Center has been hosting Konnekt Association’s events for years, and we always return with pleasure. The venue’s spacious and bright interiors, professional technical equipment, well-organized and visually impressive stage, and unique atmosphere all contribute to the success of our events. We continuously receive positive feedback from both our speakers and participants, for which we are extremely grateful.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</div></span></div>
              </div>
                      </div>
        </div>
                                      <div  class="carousel-item">
          <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-sm-12 position-relative">
                  <div class="views-field views-field-nothing"><span class="field-content"><div class="caption-wrapper">
<div class="carousel-caption">
<div class="card mb-3 box">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-3 align-self-center">
        
<img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/media_images/bvk_logo_vilagos_fekvo.png" width="175" height="76" alt="Budapesti Vállalkozásfejlesztési Közalapítvány" class="img-fluid">


    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-9">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title fw-bold mb-3">BVK</h3>
        <p>The work of the CEU Nádor Event Center’s staff can best be described by the phrase <strong>“friendly professionalism”</strong>. They are accurate, flexible, and honest, which made every project we did together easy and enjoyable.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
